#: ../apparmor/aa.py:1308
msgid ""
"Should AppArmor sanitise the environment when\n"
"switching profiles?\n"
"\n"
"Sanitising environment is more secure,\n"
"but some applications depend on the presence\n"
"of LD_PRELOAD or LD_LIBRARY_PATH."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko AppArmor treba očisti okolinu prilikom\n"
" promjene profila?\n"
" Čiscenje okoline je sigurno, \n"
"ali neke aplikacije ovise o prisustvu \n"
"LD_PRELOAD ili LD_LIBRARY_PATH."

#: ../apparmor/aa.py:1310
msgid ""
"Should AppArmor sanitise the environment when\n"
"switching profiles?\n"
"\n"
"Sanitising environment is more secure,\n"
"but this application appears to be using LD_PRELOAD\n"
"or LD_LIBRARY_PATH and sanitising the environment\n"
"could cause functionality problems."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko AppArmor treba očišćisti okolinu prilikom\n"
" prebacivanja profila?\n"
" Čisčenje okoline je sigurniji,\n"
"ali ovaj program, kako se čini pomoću LD_PRELOAD\n"
" ili LD_LIBRARY_PATH i čiščenje okoline\n"
" može uzrokovati probleme funkcionalnost."

#: ../apparmor/aa.py:1318
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Launching processes in an unconfined state is a very\n"
"dangerous operation and can cause serious security holes.\n"
"\n"
"Are you absolutely certain you wish to remove all\n"
"AppArmor protection when executing %s ?"
msgstr ""
"Pokretanje procesa u jednoaksijalnom stanje je vrlo\n"
" opasna operacija i može uzrokovati ozbiljne sigurnosne rupe.\n"
"Jeste li apsolutno sigurni da želite ukloniti svu\n"
" zaštitu AppArmor prilikom izvršavanja% s?"

#: ../apparmor/aa.py:1320
msgid ""
"Should AppArmor sanitise the environment when\n"
"running this program unconfined?\n"
"\n"
"Not sanitising the environment when unconfining\n"
"a program opens up significant security holes\n"
"and should be avoided if at all possible."
msgstr ""
"Trebam AppArmor očišće okolinu kada\n"
" je pokrenut ovaj program jednoaksijalni?\n"
"Ne čiščenje okoline kada jednoaksijalnom program \n"
"otvara značajne sigurnosne rupe\n"
" i treba ih izbjegavati ako je ikako moguće."

